  "_comment": "One 12-angle contact grid per SKU. Each is a single Nano Banana Pro generation at 1:1 / 4k \u2014 4 credits \u2014 holding a 3x4 grid of twelve camera angles of the same piece on the cream plaster e-com set. Native 4096x4096, so each tile lands near 1365x1024 and stands on its own as a PDP still. Split them with `python3 scripts/higgsfield/split_angles.py --all`.",
